 changed some threshold outcomes.","findingSource":"b-report","protocolSource":"b-protocol"},{"id":"R-01C","title":"Native NASA products retained the response.","site":"dGR101","finding":"The large complete simultaneous-visibility response survived native NASA terrain products at a common absolute observer. Synthetic averaging alone does not explain it.","limit":"Removing reporting clipping changes the earlier threshold interpretation. Different product lineages, observer conventions and residual fine-grid differences prevent a terrain-truth or achieved-convergence claim.","findingSource":"c-finding","protocolSource":"c-protocol"}],"geometry":{"latitude":{"value":-88.5134116385092,"original":"-88.5134116385092","unit":"deg","source":{"sourceId":"manifest","field":"latitude_deg","pointer":"/geometry/latitude_deg"}},"longitude":{"value":-68.01460926527753,"original":"-68.01460926527753","unit":"deg east","source":{"sourceId":"manifest","field":"longitude_east_deg","pointer":"/geometry/longitude_east_deg"}},"radius":{"value":1737400,"original":"1737400","unit":"m","source":{"sourceId":"manifest","field":"reference_radius_m","pointer":"/geometry/reference_radius_m"}},"frame":"MOON_ME_DE421","translation":"DE421","aberration":"NONE"},"footprint":"Unchanged native 80 m then 240 m nested continuation; missing data never zero","products":[{"id":"P78_5m","label":"P78 SL2 5 m","kind":"native-lola","spacing_m":5,"nasaUrl":"https://pgda.gsfc.nasa.gov/products/78","raster":"data/raw/terrain/SL2_final_adj_5mpp_surf.tif","sha256":"16737cb5fdaa47f243715e003450deadeabc6fb1b947a5ed245d5a3fd78a2208","hashScope":"Evaluated local raster bytes","description":"LOLA local"},{"id":"P90_20m","label":"P90 native 20 m","kind":"native-lola","spacing_m":20,"nasaUrl":"https://pgda.gsfc.nasa.gov/products/90","raster":"data/raw/r01c/LDEM_80S_20MPP_ADJ.TIF.native_window.tif","sha256":"cfe56ab53ec7ce7791807c884cbdd4d33412443ce8f26d620998f6a45a2154f7","hashScope":"Acquired native window raster; whole 